                  <p id="phase-ai-operation-description" className="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">{phaseAiOperationSource === 'form' ? 'Scoped Form Builder operation workspace for the selected form.' : phaseAiOperationSource === 'database' ? 'Scoped database operation workspace for the selected table.' : 'Scoped operation workspace for the current UI - UX flow.'} This panel is separate from the AI Operation menu.</p>
